sequenceDiagram
    participant harness as Harness
    participant input as Targeted input
    participant transaction as Action / observation
    harness->>input: replace_text target, text and O1
    input->>input: Match attributes and resolve a unique field
    input->>transaction: Actions and observations needed to check focus
    transaction-->>input: Current field, focus and IME state
    input->>input: Check same field, ancestors and unique focus
    alt Target focus confirmed
        input->>transaction: Clear, write and capture post-observation
        transaction-->>input: Write receipt and current field
        input->>input: Match field and compare readback text
        input-->>harness: Staged result and accepted post-observation
    else Focus unconfirmed
        input-->>harness: Return reason without writing
    end
